    {
      "id": "te59",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1255,
      "width": 1550.0800000000002,
      "height": 120.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1435920784,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 745188127,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 The scheduler starts a job on a TEE node. The harness drives the loop and enforces the budget and the deadline\n2 Agent code runs in a second isolation boundary inside the enclave. It cannot sign a receipt or read the broker's memory\n3 The only ways out of the sandbox are the LLM gateway and the tool broker. Both record what they did; neither hands a secret to the agent\n4 Credentials reach the enclave only after remote attestation succeeds, and only the broker uses them. A receipt records that an authenticated call happened, never the token\n5 Every call becomes a step. The recorder numbers it, chains it and meters its cost. Steps are append-only and the commitment covers the complete trajectory\n6 The signer seals the receipt. The body goes to the store, the root and attestation reference to the chain, and a signed pre-commitment to the requester right away",
      "originalText": "1 The scheduler starts a job on a TEE node. The harness drives the loop and enforces the budget and the deadline\n2 Agent code runs in a second isolation boundary inside the enclave. It cannot sign a receipt or read the broker's memory\n3 The only ways out of the sandbox are the LLM gateway and the tool broker. Both record what they did; neither hands a secret to the agent\n4 Credentials reach the enclave only after remote attestation succeeds, and only the broker uses them. A receipt records that an authenticated call happened, never the token\n5 Every call becomes a step. The recorder numbers it, chains it and meters its cost. Steps are append-only and the commitment covers the complete trajectory\n6 The signer seals the receipt. The body goes to the store, the root and attestation reference to the chain, and a signed pre-commitment to the requester right away",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "te60",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1389.0,
      "width": 1755.6000000000001,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 48453508,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2020027419,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If the enclave is compromised, receipts about fictional execution verify (paper assumption A5). External state bindings, vendor diversity, stake and k-of-n redundancy are the defences. Nothing here is measured",
      "originalText": "If the enclave is compromised, receipts about fictional execution verify (paper assumption A5). External state bindings, vendor diversity, stake and k-of-n redundancy are the defences. Nothing here is measured",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
